{"id":"n38918-1-10","stage":4,"title":"나지막하다 · 低","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n38918-1-10-1","ko":"이 가게는 들어올 때마다 항상 답답한 느낌이 들어.","zh":"每次走进这家店，我都总觉得里面很闷。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가게는","meaning":"店，店铺，商店","explanation":"가게：店，店铺，商店；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"가게","audio":"/audio/c013538e549a4dedbd4a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17287","senseId":"1","lemma":"가게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들어올","meaning":"进，进来","explanation":"들어오다：进，进来；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"들어오다","audio":"/audio/bcc2ebb7204dcac8a7a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74105","senseId":"1","lemma":"들어오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"때마다","meaning":"时候","explanation":"때：时候；마다：表示“每、每逢”。","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"5","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"항상","meaning":"总，总是，老，老是，经常","explanation":"항상：总，总是，老，老是，经常","readings":[{"term":"항상","audio":"/audio/f1d42a32366087dde8c3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83162","senseId":"1","lemma":"항상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"답답한","meaning":"闷，憋","explanation":"답답하다：闷，憋；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"답답하다","audio":"/audio/303de431f55bd88a5993.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49437","senseId":"4","lemma":"답답하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"느낌이","meaning":"感觉，感受","explanation":"느낌：感觉，感受；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"느낌","audio":"/audio/f376240a37fbad9834c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61166","senseId":"1","lemma":"느낌","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들어.","meaning":"有，感到","explanation":"들다：有，感到；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71686","senseId":"23","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"c013538e549a4ded","term":"가게","zh":"店，店铺，商店","audio":"/audio/c013538e549a4dedbd4a.mp3","entryId":"17287","definition":"铺放着东西来售卖的小规模铺子。","pronunciation":["가ː게"]},{"id":"bcc2ebb7204dcac8","term":"들어오다","zh":"进，进来","audio":"/audio/bcc2ebb7204dcac8a7a6.mp3","entryId":"74105","definition":"从某个范围外往里移动。","pronunciation":["드러오다"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"时候","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"74123","definition":"在某种状况下。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"f1d42a32366087dd","term":"항상","zh":"总，总是，老，老是，经常","audio":"/audio/f1d42a32366087dde8c3.mp3","entryId":"83162","definition":"无论什么时候都没变地。","pronunciation":["항상"]},{"id":"303de431f55bd88a","term":"답답하다","zh":"闷，憋","audio":"/audio/303de431f55bd88a5993.mp3","entryId":"49437","definition":"空间窄，感觉不舒服。","pronunciation":["답따파다"]},{"id":"f376240a37fbad98","term":"느낌","zh":"感觉，感受","audio":"/audio/f376240a37fbad9834c5.mp3","entryId":"61166","definition":"身体或内心产生的情绪或情感。","pronunciation":["느낌"]},{"id":"7ff37822e89462ea","term":"들다","zh":"有，感到","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3","entryId":"71686","definition":"对某物产生想法或感觉。","pronunciation":["들다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7498657a43a9a1508fb2.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n38918-1-10-2","ko":"천정이 나지막해서 그런가?","zh":"是因为天花板太低了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"천정이","meaning":"天花板","explanation":"천정：天花板；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"천정","audio":"/audio/84084be8980bcce3347a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:천정:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"천정","origin":"course-authored supplement"}]},{"text":"나지막해서","meaning":"低，低矮","explanation":"나지막하다：低，低矮；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"나지막하다","audio":"/audio/ea6b8cdc22a0b2f4c764.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38918","senseId":"1","lemma":"나지막하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그런가?","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；ㄴ가：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"84084be8980bcce3","term":"천정","zh":"天花板","audio":"/audio/84084be8980bcce3347a.mp3","definition":"천장 的非标准说法；正文保留原对话写法，通常建议使用 천장。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"ea6b8cdc22a0b2f4","term":"나지막하다","zh":"低，低矮","audio":"/audio/ea6b8cdc22a0b2f4c764.mp3","entryId":"38918","definition":"位置或高度稍微低一些。","pronunciation":["나지마카다"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]}],"audio":"/audio/e5c51b5fa5725c66ef18.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.58,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=38918","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":128,"sequenceScore":2.4067,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是因为天花板太低了吗？","每次走进这家店，我都总觉得里面很闷。","电影的最后一个场景真的太棒了吧？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["每次走进这家店，我都总觉得里面很闷。","电影的最后一个场景真的太棒了吧？","是因为天花板太低了吗？"],"answer":2}]}
